{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y对音乐细部和感受变化的描写有所压缩，尤其缺少X那种随具体乐句逐步展开的声音层次、身体触感和微妙情绪转折。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的短句、重点加亮和碎片化感受更方便边听边扫，音乐细节也更丰富细腻；但人物心理有时被拆得太碎，观众需要自己拼接动机。Y虽然话更长，却把每段发生了什么、为什么这样反应、前一刻如何影响下一刻交代得更清楚，尤其把从害怕暴露喜欢到接受不确定的心理变化连成了完整过程。整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众真正理解这个人，而不只是接收到一连串漂亮的情绪和意象。</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9bfa6c31-e6dd-406a-b70f-05b61a0bc530", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212152554155Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:22:38.549803+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "843ad26b156df978ee5de9f0745f2375a347cf608668f4591c101c7c893c54bd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506